   'Sterling Silver Navajo Pearl Squash Blossom Necklace - Presley Haley', 'This stunning brushed-finish sterling silver Navajo Pearl Squash Blossom necklace was made by Navajo silversmith Presley Haley. The single bead is stamped PH and Sterling. Length: 20" Naja Length: 2 1/4" Naja Width: 2 1/8" Blossom Length: 1 1/8" Blossom Width: 3/8" Bead Size: 8mm x 10mm Free shipping on all orders! We ship with USPS and always include tracking. All orders ship within a day of payment. Returns are accepted up to 30 days after you receive your order. Just send us a message. Our shop offers cash back or store credit. The item must be returned in new condition.', 'statement-pieces',
