  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-navajo-sterling-silver-cuff-bracelet-1970s', '4353958543', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4353958543/vintage-navajo-sterling-silver-cuff?click_key=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%3ALT955350555bdf6c8eadf217754ebedf0615142050&click_sum=a15db92d&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-89344-10-46&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&sts=1&content_source=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%253ALT955350555bdf6c8eadf217754ebedf0615142050',
   'Vintage Navajo Sterling Silver Cuff Bracelet (1970s)', 'Up for your consideration is a vintage Navajo sterling silver cuff bracelet, dating back to the 1970s. This handcrafted piece showcases traditional Native American artistry, featuring bold geometric and linear stampwork designs deeply etched into the silver surface. The cuff measures approximately 6 inches in length with a width of about 0.75 inches at its widest point. Its minimalist yet powerful design highlights the beauty of hand-stamped Navajo silverwork, with subtle oxidation adding depth and contrast to the patterns. The smooth brushed finish complements the detailed motifs, giving this bracelet a timeless Southwestern character. A striking collectible piece of Navajo craftsmanship, perfect for both wear and display.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
