   'Turquoise Squash Blossom Necklace, Western Double Strand Beaded Necklace, Natural Stone Statement Necklace, Navajo Style Jewelry', 'Make a bold Southwestern statement with this 🤠 30" full squash blossom turquoise necklace. Featuring a stunning 💎 3" turquoise pendant and classic 🌵 6mm Navajo-style beads, this piece is made to turn heads. Each necklace is handmade with natural stone, so color and shape may vary — giving every piece its own unique character. ⚖️ 175 grams, it’s a true showpiece with substance and style. 🍃 Nickel, Lead & Chrome free – safe for sensitive skin. 🌟 Product Features: 📏 Length: 30" necklace with 3 toggle closures 💎 Pendant: 3" natural stone pendant 🔘 Beads: 6mm Navajo beads ⚖️ Weight: 175 grams – bold, heavy statement piece 🍃 Nickel, Lead & Chrome free – skin-safe ✋ Note: Natural stone may vary in size, shape, or color', 'statement-pieces',
