  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-southwest-navajo-pearl-lapis-beaded-hoop-earrings', '4494083953', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4494083953/vintage-southwest-navajo-pearl-lapis?click_key=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%3ALTb782d74ba9cb97303a303d847f730d5c4a048199&click_sum=c17c24f9&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-89344-10-42&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%253ALTb782d74ba9cb97303a303d847f730d5c4a048199',
   'Vintage Southwest Navajo Pearl & Lapis Beaded Hoop Earrings', 'Vintage southwestern Sterling silver beaded hoop earrings with oval Lapis lazuli setting, 13.11 grams total weight, 2 1/2” long, 1 1/2” diameter, wire style closure, 10 graduated size Navajo pearls 4mm, 7mm, 9mm, 6 oval Lapis lazuli cabochon, deeply bezel set in Sterling silver, 4x 5mm oval Lapis cabochon, 2x 6mm oval Lapis cabochon, set on Sterling silver hand hammered hoops, by Fan Dodson Designs All of our jewelry is authentic Dan Dodson manufactured prior to his death in 2020 We have limited quantity, and these items are no longer in production. All Dan Dodson designs are made in Jaipur. Returns/Exchanges: We kindly ask that all cancellations are requested within 1 hour of placing your order. We pack orders quickly, and sometimes ship the very same day. We are happy to accept eligible returns in exchange for store credit. All cash refunds for returns on items which arrive as described are subject to a restocking fee. Item must be in its original undamaged condition and shipped within 7 days of original delivery. We do not offer paid shipping labels for any returns. Orders damaged in transit must be reported within 48 hours of delivery and include photos of both the parcel and its contents. All other pre-existing defects must be reported within 48 hours of the item’s delivery and include photos of the issue. Damage sustained after delivery is nonrefundable. Any returns or cancellations that fall outside our terms must be individually negotiated. We reserve the right to assess the eligibility of all returns upon our receipt and examination of the items. We do not take responsibility for the actions of USPS, and cannot offer refunds for the non-delivery of any item officially marked “Delivered” by USPS tracking information.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
