  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'holiday-gift-sterling-silver-navajo-pearl-pink-conch-heart-bracelet-western-boho', '4609892859', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4609892859/holiday-gift-sterling-silver-navajo?click_key=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%3ALTe3e7312eb2d52f0d3506c16faaa766b9a9856ccd&click_sum=f6110eb0&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-89344-10-39&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%253ALTe3e7312eb2d52f0d3506c16faaa766b9a9856ccd',
   'Holiday Gift Sterling Silver Navajo Pearl Pink Conch Heart Bracelet, Western Boho Beaded Bracelet For Her, Dainty Christmas Jewelry Gift', 'Give a one of a kind gift from the heart this holiday season! Looking for a meaningful, stunning gift they’ll actually wear every day? This dainty Sterling Silver Navajo Pearl & Pink Conch Heart Bracelet strikes the perfect balance between Southwestern tradition and modern elegance. Handcrafted with sterling silver Navajo Pearls and a pink conch heart, it’s a beautiful standalone piece or the ultimate anchor for a jewelry stack. Why it makes the perfect holiday gift: • Premium Materials: Crafted with genuine sterling silver Navajo Oearls and authentic pink conch shell. • Gift-Ready Presentation: Arrives beautifully packaged and ready to unwrap—no extra gift-wrapping stress required. • Versatile Style: At 7.5 inches with a secure lobster claw clasp, it wears comfortably alone or layered. The Details: • Length: 7.5" • Closure: Secure sterling silver lobster claw clasp. • Fast Shipping: Ships directly from Farmington, New Mexico. 🔄 EXCHANGE POLICY Exchanges are welcomed within 7 days of delivery for unworn, undamaged items in original condition. Buyers cover return shipping, and free-shipping orders will have original shipping costs deducted from the exchange credit.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
