   'Navajo style Pearls Necklace 2 lengths available please read full description before purchase', 'I have made this necklace using beautiful navajo STYLE Pearl beads that are Real Solid Hematite, a gemstone, and will never tarnish. This photo is 17", but you can order one at 19". PLEASE look at all of the photos so that you can see the details. This comes in a gift box and shipping is FREE! Care; I use quality components to ensure that jewelry purchased here is a good value. That being said, this piece is delicate and will not stand up to being pulled on, slept in, worn while showering, swimming, playing sports or other high impact activities. Not for children. In order to keep this looking it''s best; when not wearing, always keep in a closed jewelry box or any container that limits oxygen, moisture and light. Please note - I am not Navajo and I am not claiming to be Native American, I offer these items as the STYLE that I love and want to share with you. Everything in my shop IS MADE BY ME. Please look at the reviews to see how much buyers love these for the excellent quality and great value. If I have not answered all of your questions, please use the contact feature to ask me. Thank you for looking. This link will take you to my etsy store front. https://www.etsy.com/shop/OregonJewelryGarden?ref=hdr_shop_menu', 'turquoise-jewelry',
