  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-navajo-sterling-silver-horse-mosaic-turquoise-cuff-bracelet-6-6-inch-sig', '4332493428', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4332493428/vintage-navajo-sterling-silver-horse?click_key=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%3ALT41d0c688a060f3884dcd510760a905c6ecd7469f&click_sum=23e5609a&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-89344-10-32&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%253ALT41d0c688a060f3884dcd510760a905c6ecd7469f',
   'Vintage Navajo Sterling Silver Horse Mosaic Turquoise Cuff Bracelet 6.6 Inch Signed', 'Beautiful vintage Sterling Silver cuff with a 34 mm x 28 mm prancing Horse set with a mosaic of natural Turquoise, Spiny Oyster shell, Gaspeite, Malachite, and Lapis Lazuli. Stamped with a partially covered maker''s mark and ''sterling'', this wonderful cuff has been cleaned but not polished and is in excellent condition. The inside of the bracelet measures approximately 61 mm (2.4 in) wide and 44 mm (1.7 in) tall, with a gap of 28 mm (1.1 in), creating an inner circumference of approximately 170 mm (6.6 in), Ladies size L or Mens size S. ----SHIPPING INFORMATION---- We ship Monday through Friday, usually within 1 business day of receiving payment. Everything is shipped well-protected so you should always receive your item in the same condition it left us. Unless required by customs to international buyers, we ship with no jewelry-related terms on the packaging for your protection and ours. We sometimes use repurposed padding to protect items during shipping and minimize our environmental impact. ----Terms of Sale---- All items are described in detail and are presented with multiple photographs, so when you purchase from us you can be assured you will receive exactly what you paid for. Please take the time to read the item description and look at all of the photos. If you have a question, ask before you buy. If you like the best jewelry at the best prices you will be happy you shopped with us! All online sales are final.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
