  (uuid_generate_v4(), '1-5-vintage-round-hand-stamped-sterling-earrings-native-american-stamped-sterlin', '1815711453', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1815711453/15-vintage-round-hand-stamped-sterling?click_key=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%3ALT1079141f4fbfb3955fce11061fd7134ca06f0738&click_sum=9606dd01&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-89344-10-30&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%253ALT1079141f4fbfb3955fce11061fd7134ca06f0738',
   '1.5" Vintage Round Hand Stamped Sterling Earrings Native American Stamped Sterling Earrings Large Unique Sterling Earrings', '1.5" Vintage Round Hand Stamped Sterling Earrings Native American Stamped Sterling Earrings Large Unique Sterling Earrings 18.2 grams total, each one weighs 9+ grams which is right at the weight of 2 nickels, nickel=4.98 grams. These are unsigned and have been revamped from post style into dangles with new sturdy sterling wires. They are hand stamped as you can see by the differences between the two earrings....they are not exact but are very beautiful and made by a silversmith with steady hands...hand stamping is a one-shot sort of artistry...one mistake and you have to start all over again. As I was taking the closeups I saw that there are a few spots where the blacking or patina is missing; I will repair/replace these areas before shipping. Guaranteed sterling.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
