   '1.75" Lovely Oval Pink Rose Quartz Vintage Sterling Earrings Large Signed Hand Stamped Native American Earrings Excellent Condition New Wire', '1.75" Lovely Oval Pink Rose Quartz Vintage Sterling Earrings Large Signed Hand Stamped Native American Earrings Excellent condition, natural inclusions in the stones, no cracks or damage...the signature/stamp/hallmark is an older one. Bought as Navajo handmade but I cannot verify that information. Revamped from posts into dangles with new sturdy sterling wires. Total weight: 25.25 grams, each one weighs about 2 nickels and a dime. Nickel=4.98 g Dime=2.33 g Rose Quartz is a translucent pink precious stone. It is known as the ‘Affection Stone'' and is said to be the stone of unequivocal adoration. This gem opens the Heart Chakra and can help you to relinquish outrage, disdain and addiction or out of control desire. Rose Quartz can help you in figuring out how to adore yourself and how to let another person love you. Wear Rose Quartz over the heart or keep it near you in your pocket or handbag. It can likewise be set in the relationship corner of your home to draw in adoration. (Which is the most distant right-hand corner as you enter your front door. Putting Rose Quartz by your bed or under your mattress can help you rest more peacefully.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
