  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-nugget-turquoise-earrings-big-chunky-turquoise-earrings-lots-of-matrix-r', '4406815547', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4406815547/vintage-nugget-turquoise-earrings-big?click_key=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%3ALT3cc50c0794b12de4fd8b8714bc4f1fbb8b4eb3c1&click_sum=5bddbeff&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-89344-10-22&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%253ALT3cc50c0794b12de4fd8b8714bc4f1fbb8b4eb3c1',
   'Vintage Nugget Turquoise Earrings Big Chunky Turquoise Earrings Lots of Matrix Revamped New Sturdy Sterling Wires Solid and Sturdy', 'Big Chunky Vintage Nugget Turquoise Earrings with Lots of Matrix Revamped with New Sturdy Sterling Wires 17.8 grams total, each one weighing a bit less than 9 grams, a quarter weighs 5.67 grams. These were well-worn watch tips that I remade into earrings... super gorgeous, large and chunky, high-quality turquoise... see the photos of the backs of the earrings so you can see how they still have some of the watch tip parts... I did not want to remove any of the support metal surrounding the stones... you can''t see that detail from the front... I think they are simply magnificent! Unsigned, guaranteed sterling and genuine turquoise. (See the last photo for reference showing them as watch tips).', 'turquoise-jewelry',
