  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-navajo-sterling-silver-coral-foliate-dangle-earrings', '1333084415', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1333084415/vintage-navajo-sterling-silver-coral?click_key=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%3ALT0249db710b66dc637109f24d104e2ddef51a9bc1&click_sum=149e7271&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-89344-10-20&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&cns=1&sts=1&content_source=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%253ALT0249db710b66dc637109f24d104e2ddef51a9bc1',
   'Vintage Navajo Sterling silver & Coral Foliate Dangle Earrings', 'These earrings are like wonderful little sculptures made of sterling silver. On the earlobe, an open blossom anchors the composition. Dangling from that is a large stylized leaf, with another leaf and a coiled vine appliqued on top of of it. This dimensional quality is just lovely, and then each earring is also embellished by a bezel-set Coral stone. No matter how long you look at these, you will keep finding additional stamped or carved details. They are really special. They''re also light and comfortable, and in excellent condition. They are unsigned but test as sterling silver. I am guessing tat they date to the late 1990''s or early 2000''s.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
