  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-pink-rhodochrosite-stalactite-slice-native-american-sterling-bezel-signe', '4392748440', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4392748440/vintage-pink-rhodochrosite-stalactite?click_key=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%3ALTe2f70a15f54c5a2b4b8fe887f6f2ac778e4d840e&click_sum=36d92b2b&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-89344-10-19&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&sts=1&content_source=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%253ALTe2f70a15f54c5a2b4b8fe887f6f2ac778e4d840e',
   'Vintage Pink Rhodochrosite Stalactite Slice Native American Sterling Bezel Signed 8 Arrow 3 New Sterling Wires Small Rhodochrosite Earrings', 'Small Vintage Pink Rhodochrosite Stalactite Slice Native American Sterling Bezel Set Earrings Each earring has two ''rosettes'', one on each side of the stone. Each one is signed with what looks like an 8 with an arrow upward through it and a 3 beside that. New Sterling Wires What is Rhodochrosite? Rhodochrosite is a manganese carbonate mineral (MnCO₃) that ranges in color from light pink to bright red. It is primarily found in hydrothermal veins and is known for its beautiful banding and unique patterns. The most famous variety, often referred to as "Inca rose," is translucent to opaque and features delicate concentric rings of color. Rhodochrosite is associated with the loving heart chakra, the solar plexus chakra, and powerful emotional healing properties. This beautiful pink crystal is often used to balance emotions, uplift the spirit, and promote a positive and cheerful outlook on life... pink quartz crystals may help bring a deep sense of self-compassion and help release resentments.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
