  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'western-pearl-barrel-bead-necklace-silver-style-lariat-southwestern-reproduction', '4497537008', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4497537008/western-pearl-barrel-bead-necklace?click_key=Euvi7hhn0ZWXj9DR2e8OLySZkf1f%3ALTe6bfaef5c433ebafb04966509437df8b0351f451&click_sum=45e1b398&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-89343-10-12&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&sts=1',
   'Western Pearl & Barrel Bead Necklace | Silver Style Lariat | Southwestern Reproduction', 'Western pearl and engraved barrel bead necklace in a burnished silver finish. This beautiful Southwestern reproduction offers the look of an authentic sterling silver necklace without the high price. The combination of Western-style pearls, detailed barrel beads, and the lariat-inspired drop gives it a substantial, realistic appearance. I wear this necklace myself, and honestly, nobody can tell the difference—it is very pretty on! Wear it alone as a statement necklace or layer it with your favorite turquoise and silver pieces. • Burnished silver-colored alloy and hard-enamel beads • Detailed engraved barrel bead design • Authentic-looking Southwestern reproduction • 24″ necklace plus 3″ extension chain • Nicely weighted without feeling heavy • Beautiful worn alone or layered Please note: This is a silver-style reproduction and is not sterling silver or Native-made. A Note About Our Photography Some lifestyle images may feature AI-generated models or digitally enhanced backgrounds to illustrate how our jewelry looks when worn. We also include photographs of the actual jewelry, and all measurements and product details are provided for accuracy.', 'statement-pieces',
