  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'sterling-silver-and-turquoise-navajo-pearl-earrings-beaded-sterling-hoops-stampe', '732422075', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/732422075/sterling-silver-and-turquoise-navajo?click_key=Euvi7hhn0ZWXj9DR2e8OLySZkf1f%3ALTd0b2fc2246f75da842c6073f90ca5fd71b924662&click_sum=f1d96585&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-89343-10-11&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&cns=1',
   'Sterling Silver and Turquoise Navajo Pearl Earrings, Beaded Sterling Hoops, Stamped Bench Beads, Oxidized Silver Beads, Navajo Pearls Pair', 'A gorgeous pair of handmade sterling silver and turquoise earrings has 8mm stamped sterling bench beads interspersed with high quality blue turquoise rondelles. Beads are stamped, domed and soldered in New Mexico, then hand file-finished, oxidized, tumbled, and strung together by me, here in beautiful Tucson, Arizona. ♥ 2 1/2" in length including sterling earwire ♥ eight 8mm handmade sterling beads with deep stamped design ♥ 1/2" bright sterling cones with handmade saucer beads under each ♥ all sterling beads are handmade ♥ five high quality natural blue turquoise rondelle beads on each earring ♥ strong yet flexible, and very comfortable to wear Ready to ship in 5-7 business days SEE MY OTHER SOUTHWEST JEWELRY HERE: https://www.etsy.com/shop/OldPuebloSilverworks?ref=simple-shop-header-name&listing_id=667545968§ion_id=14009662 I ALSO MAKE STERLING BANGLES: https://www.etsy.com/shop/OldPuebloSilverworks?ref=simple-shop-header-name&listing_id=667545968§ion_id=14009654 LASTLY, I MAKE SOUTHWEST STYLE ID TAGS FOR YOUR PUPS under my own Urban Puppy brand! To see them, click here: https://www.etsy.com/shop/OldPuebloSilverworks?ref=simple-shop-header-name&listing_id=667545968§ion_id=14036239 © Copyright 2009 - 2026 Old Pueblo Silverworks/Urban Puppy, Tucson, Arizona, all rights reserved. Content, including jewelry designs and their photographs may not be used without explicit permission of the artist.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
