  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'kingman-turquoise-dangling-1-5-hoop-earrings-navajo-signed', '4573400300', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4573400300/kingman-turquoise-dangling-15-hoop?click_key=Euvi7hhn0ZWXj9DR2e8OLySZkf1f%3ALTa0a15518d0a433f349223e71c1831ecd19d40971&click_sum=560282f3&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-89343-10-8&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&pro=1&frs=1&sts=1',
   'Kingman Turquoise Dangling 1.5” Hoop Earrings Navajo Signed', 'Kingman Turquoise Sterling Silver Dangling Hoop Earrings | Southwestern Handmade Jewelry Add a touch of authentic Southwestern style to your jewelry collection with these beautiful Kingman turquoise dangling hoop earrings. Each earring features a vibrant blue Kingman turquoise cabochon accented by natural matrix and character, making every stone unique. The turquoise is set in a classic sterling silver sawtooth bezel and suspended from a sleek, lightweight silver hoop for an effortlessly stylish look. The earrings are hallmarked “D” and “STERLING,” adding to their authenticity and artisan character. Details: * 💎 Genuine Kingman turquoise * 🩶 Sterling silver construction * ✨ Hallmarked “D” and “STERLING” * 🌵 Southwestern / Native-inspired design * Handmade artisan jewelry * Natural turquoise matrix — no two stones are exactly alike * Lightweight dangling hoop style weighing in at 6.21 grams * Perfect for everyday wear or adding Southwestern flair to a special outfit Expect quality and great prices at Turquoise Vault! *****Please note: One earring does have a fracture in the stone! It is very stable and secure in the setting, I just wanna note this. Hard to see with the naked eye.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
