  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'vintage-navajo-sterling-silver-with-royston-turquoise-clip-on-earrings-marked', '4563988711', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/4563988711/vintage-navajo-sterling-silver-with?click_key=Euvi7hhn0ZWXj9DR2e8OLySZkf1f%3ALT112eabce0de36fadfa69096dd384c2b9c4c9ca73&click_sum=77c1fca9&ls=a&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-89343-10-5&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&cns=1',
   'Vintage Navajo Sterling Silver with Royston Turquoise Clip On Earrings MARKED', 'Vintage Navajo Sterling Silver with Royston Turquoise Clip On Earrings. Stamped in Script E. Spencer over STERLING. This is the Navajo Silversmith Evelyn Spencer who is know to make clip on earrings on occasion. Reclaimed from an auction. I am providing free shipping on orders over $35, and this prevents me from accepting returns. Findings on some items are steel or nickel that can rust if gotten wet. Stones and stone inlay set by Native American Silversmiths are not recommended to be gotten wet. This can cause the stones to pop out of their settings. Items are insured and require that the buyer takes reasonable measures to notice packaging damages and record them so that a claim can be filed. Damaged packages need to be reported to me within 7 days of receiving them. Photos are very close up and show details of the item that is not visible with the naked eye. Most items are used pre-owned sourced from liquidations, auctions, garage sales, thrift stores, flea markets, and traders nationwide. Items that are made by me are listed as such and are hallmarked. Estimated Profit has endeavored to accurately describe all items being sold but all property herein offered for sale is strictly "as is" and it is the buyer''s responsibility to determine exact condition of each item. No statement in descriptions, invoice or elsewhere shall be deemed to be a warranty, representation, or assumption of liability with respects to age, condition, size, quality, variety, importance, provenance or historical relevance of any of these items. Any such statements are strictly matters of opinion.', 'turquoise-jewelry',
