  (uuid_generate_v4(), 'rope-style-letter-turquoise-charm-necklace-with-chain-navajo-handmade', '1617243783', 'https://www.etsy.com/listing/1617243783/lettercharm-turquoise-pendant-sterling?click_key=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%3ALT28397224127803c0ea592db981d7dc87bb2b6478&click_sum=e318bd2d&ls=s&ga_order=most_relevant&ga_search_type=all&ga_view_type=gallery&ga_search_query=Navajo+jewelry&ref=search_grid-960714-10-6&sr_prefetch=1&pf_from=search&frs=1&etp=1&content_source=5c75ed83-faac-4cf9-9683-2746579226dc%253ALT28397224127803c0ea592db981d7dc87bb2b6478',
   'Rope Style Letter & Turquoise Charm Necklace with Chain Navajo Handmade', '**Please know prices may increase due to the silver market. ** The sterling silver letter measures 1" tall and the width varies with every letter. It comes with a turquoise stone that each have their own characteristics and prices. These pendants come with an 18" sterling silver rolo chain. Both pieces are made with sterling silver and come with a standard circle jump ring bail that can fit 5 mm Navajo Pearls. The pendants in the video were made for that specific chain and have a bail that can fit 7mm Navajo Pearls. Please advise if you would like this style of bail. If you would like to know the sizing of a stone or would like a closer photo, please do not hesitate to contact me. Please advise if your order is a gift and the date needed by so I may plan accordingly or contact me to get a rough ship by date. **Please contact me if you have any questions or concerns such as adjust the size of the jump ring. **If there are any suggestions as to the type of stones you would like to see, please do not hesitate to contact me. I will do my best to add those in my list of stones as well. Thank you!', 'statement-pieces',
